(function(E){ const x = E["exam-03"] = E["exam-03"] || {units:{}}; (x.units = x.units || {})["x03-l1"] = {"id":"x03-l1","patterns":["L1-travel","PARA-money","PARA-time"],"title":{"en":"Listening Part 1: advice on a trip","tr":"Listening Part 1: bir gezi için tavsiye","fa":"Listening Part 1: توصیه برای یک سفر"},"objective":{"en":"In this lesson you will learn to complete ten notes while one friend gives another advice about a trip: follow the note headings, pick the time and the price that apply, and write one word or a number exactly.","tr":"Bu derste bir arkadaş diğerine bir gezi hakkında tavsiye verirken on notu tamamlamayı öğreneceksin: not başlıklarını takip edecek, geçerli olan saati ve fiyatı seçecek ve tek bir kelimeyi ya da sayıyı aynen yazacaksın.","fa":"در این درس یاد می‌گیری وقتی یک دوست به دوست دیگرش درباره‌ی یک سفر توصیه می‌کند، ده یادداشت را کامل کنی: عنوان‌های یادداشت را دنبال کنی، ساعت و قیمتی را که درست است انتخاب کنی و یک کلمه یا یک عدد را دقیق بنویسی."},"sessions":[["explain"],["drill"],["exit"]],"explain":{"title":{"en":"Listening Part 1: advice on a trip","tr":"Listening Part 1: bir gezi için tavsiye","fa":"Listening Part 1: توصیه برای یک سفر"},"objective":{"en":"In this lesson you will learn to complete ten notes while one friend gives another advice about a trip: follow the note headings, pick the time and the price that apply, and write one word or a number exactly.","tr":"Bu derste bir arkadaş diğerine bir gezi hakkında tavsiye verirken on notu tamamlamayı öğreneceksin: not başlıklarını takip edecek, geçerli olan saati ve fiyatı seçecek ve tek bir kelimeyi ya da sayıyı aynen yazacaksın.","fa":"در این درس یاد می‌گیری وقتی یک دوست به دوست دیگرش درباره‌ی یک سفر توصیه می‌کند، ده یادداشت را کامل کنی: عنوان‌های یادداشت را دنبال کنی، ساعت و قیمتی را که درست است انتخاب کنی و یک کلمه یا یک عدد را دقیق بنویسی."},"stats":[{"label":{"en":"Questions","tr":"Soru","fa":"سؤال"},"value":"10"},{"label":{"en":"Speakers","tr":"Konuşan","fa":"گوینده"},"value":"2"},{"label":{"en":"Word limit","tr":"Kelime sınırı","fa":"سقف کلمه"},"value":{"en":"1 word / number","tr":"1 kelime / sayı","fa":"۱ کلمه / عدد"}}],"context":{"eyebrow":{"en":"1 The context","tr":"1 Bağlam","fa":"۱ بافت"},"head":{"en":"This exam: a boat trip to an island","tr":"Bu sınav: bir adaya tekne gezisi","fa":"این آزمون: سفر با قایق به یک جزیره"},"intro":{"en":"Part 1 is an everyday conversation in which one person needs information. Trips, holidays and local events come up often, and here the information comes from a friend, so the language is relaxed and full of changes of mind.","tr":"Part 1, bir kişinin bilgiye ihtiyaç duyduğu günlük bir konuşmadır. Geziler, tatiller ve yerel etkinlikler sık çıkar; burada bilgi bir arkadaştan geliyor, bu yüzden dil rahat ve fikir değiştirmelerle dolu.","fa":"Part 1 یک گفتگوی روزمره است که در آن یک نفر به اطلاعات نیاز دارد. سفر، تعطیلات و رویدادهای محلی زیاد می‌آیند و این‌جا اطلاعات را یک دوست می‌دهد، پس زبان خودمانی و پر از «نه، ببخشید...» است."},"technique":{"en":"2 The technique","tr":"2 Teknik","fa":"۲ تکنیک"},"labels":{"asks":{"en":"What this part is about","tr":"Bu kısım ne hakkında","fa":"این بخش درباره‌ی چیست"},"fields":{"en":"Headings you will see","tr":"Göreceğin başlıklar","fa":"عنوان‌هایی که می‌بینی"},"words":{"en":"Words that carry the answers","tr":"Cevabı taşıyan kelimeler","fa":"کلمه‌هایی که جواب را می‌آورند"},"a":{"en":"On the paper","tr":"Kâğıtta","fa":"روی برگه"},"b":{"en":"What you hear or read","tr":"Duyduğun ya da okuduğun","fa":"چیزی که می‌شنوی یا می‌خوانی"},"traps":{"en":"Traps","tr":"Tuzaklar","fa":"دام‌ها"},"example":{"en":"Example","tr":"Örnek","fa":"نمونه"},"ideas":{"en":"Ideas","tr":"Fikirler","fa":"ایده‌ها"}},"cards":[{"id":"x03-l1-ctx","exam":true,"patterns":["L1-travel","PARA-money","PARA-time"],"often":{"pattern":"L1-travel","n":7,"of":40,"label":{"en":"Comes up often in the real exam: 7 of the last 40 tests","tr":"Gerçek sınavda sık çıkar: son 40 sınavın 7’sinde","fa":"در آزمون واقعی زیاد می‌آید: در ۷ آزمون از ۴۰ آزمونِ اخیر"}},"title":{"en":"Advice on a day trip","tr":"Günübirlik bir gezi için tavsiye","fa":"توصیه برای یک سفر یک‌روزه"},"asks":{"en":"Two friends talk: one has made a trip by boat to an island, the other is planning it. Notes cover getting there (times, prices, tickets), what to do on the island and practical tips.","tr":"İki arkadaş konuşuyor: biri tekneyle bir adaya gitmiş, diğeri bu geziyi planlıyor. Notlar oraya nasıl gidileceğini (saatler, fiyatlar, biletler), adada ne yapılacağını ve pratik ipuçlarını kapsıyor.","fa":"دو دوست حرف می‌زنند: یکی با قایق به جزیره‌ای رفته و دیگری دارد برای این سفر برنامه می‌ریزد. یادداشت‌ها شامل رفتن (ساعت، قیمت، بلیت)، کارهایی که در جزیره می‌شود کرد و نکته‌های کاربردی‌اند."},"fields":["Getting there","Times","Tickets and prices","On the island","Food","Practical tips","Getting back"],"words":[{"a":"leave from","b":"depart from / go from","tr":"... kalkmak","fa":"از ... حرکت کردن"},{"a":"timetable","b":"the list of times","tr":"tarife","fa":"جدول زمانی"},{"a":"a return (ticket)","b":"there and back","tr":"gidiş-dönüş bilet","fa":"بلیت رفت‌وبرگشت"},{"a":"book online","b":"buy on the website before you go","tr":"internetten ayırtmak","fa":"آنلاین رزرو کردن"},{"a":"on board","b":"on the boat / during the trip","tr":"teknede","fa":"داخل قایق"},{"a":"the crossing","b":"the journey across the water","tr":"geçiş, karşıya geçme","fa":"عبور از آب"},{"a":"hire","b":"rent / pay to use for a short time","tr":"kiralamak","fa":"کرایه کردن"},{"a":"round the island","b":"all the way around","tr":"adanın çevresinde","fa":"دور جزیره"},{"a":"closed on Mondays","b":"not open at the start of the week","tr":"pazartesileri kapalı","fa":"دوشنبه‌ها تعطیل"},{"a":"shelter","b":"a place to keep out of the rain","tr":"sığınak, korunacak yer","fa":"سرپناه"},{"a":"the last boat back","b":"the final return trip","tr":"dönüş için son tekne","fa":"آخرین قایق برگشت"},{"a":"definitely","b":"you must / don’t miss it","tr":"kesinlikle","fa":"حتماً"}],"traps":[{"en":"Two times: \"It was half past ten... no, that was the summer timetable. Now it’s eleven.\" Write the time that applies to the trip being planned.","tr":"İki saat: \"On buçuktu... yok, o yaz tarifesiydi. Şimdi on bir.\" Planlanan gezi için geçerli olan saati yaz.","fa":"دو ساعت: «ده و نیم بود... نه، آن جدول تابستان بود. الان یازده است». ساعتی را بنویس که برای سفرِ در حال برنامه‌ریزی درست است."},{"en":"Two prices: the price \"if you just turn up\" and the price \"if you book ahead\". The notes tell you which one they want.","tr":"İki fiyat: \"öylece gidersen\" fiyatı ve \"önceden ayırtırsan\" fiyatı. Hangisinin istendiğini notlar söyler.","fa":"دو قیمت: قیمتِ «اگر همین‌طوری بروی» و قیمتِ «اگر از قبل رزرو کنی». یادداشت‌ها می‌گویند کدام را می‌خواهند."},{"en":"A word printed after the gap: \"meet at the ___ entrance\". Write only the missing word; \"entrance\" is already there.","tr":"Boşluktan sonra yazılı bir kelime: \"meet at the ___ entrance\". Yalnızca eksik kelimeyi yaz; \"entrance\" zaten orada.","fa":"کلمه‌ای که بعد از جای خالی چاپ شده: «meet at the ___ entrance». فقط کلمه‌ی جاافتاده را بنویس؛ «entrance» از قبل هست."}],"example":{"lines":[["Friend 1","The bus used to leave from the market square."],["Friend 2","Is that still the stop?"],["Friend 1","No, it goes from outside the library now."]],"item":"Bus leaves from outside the ___","answer":"library","why":{"en":"The market square was the old stop. \"Now\" gives the detail you need.","tr":"Pazar meydanı eski duraktı. \"Now\" gereken bilgiyi veriyor.","fa":"میدان بازار ایستگاه قبلی بود. «now» اطلاعات لازم را می‌دهد."}}},{"id":"L1-travel","ctx":["L1-travel"],"title":{"en":"A trip, a holiday or a local event","tr":"Bir gezi, bir tatil ya da yerel bir etkinlik","fa":"سفر، تعطیلات یا یک رویداد محلی"},"asks":{"en":"A caller books or asks about a trip, a holiday cottage, a festival or an excursion, or a friend gives travel advice. The notes collect places, dates, prices, what is included and what to book in advance.","tr":"Arayan bir gezi, bir tatil evi, bir festival ya da bir tur için yer ayırtır ya da bilgi alır; ya da bir arkadaş seyahat tavsiyesi verir. Notlar yerleri, tarihleri, fiyatları, nelerin dahil olduğunu ve neyin önceden ayırtılması gerektiğini toplar.","fa":"تماس‌گیرنده یک سفر، یک ویلای تعطیلات، یک جشنواره یا یک گردش را رزرو می‌کند یا درباره‌اش می‌پرسد، یا دوستی توصیه‌ی سفر می‌دهد. یادداشت‌ها جاها، تاریخ‌ها، قیمت‌ها، چیزهایی که شامل می‌شود و چیزهایی که باید از قبل رزرو کرد را جمع می‌کنند."},"fields":["Destination","Dates / length of stay","Accommodation","Price per person","What is included","Transport","Things to see or do","Tickets / booking"],"words":[{"a":"return ticket","b":"there and back","tr":"gidiş-dönüş bileti","fa":"بلیت رفت‌وبرگشت"},{"a":"included","b":"you don't pay extra for / it comes with","tr":"dahil","fa":"شامل قیمت"},{"a":"per person","b":"each / for every adult","tr":"kişi başı","fa":"برای هر نفر"},{"a":"in advance","b":"book ahead / before you go","tr":"önceden","fa":"از قبل"},{"a":"departure","b":"it leaves at / we set off","tr":"kalkış","fa":"حرکت"},{"a":"cancellation","b":"if you can't come / call it off","tr":"iptal","fa":"لغو"},{"a":"excursion","b":"a day trip to","tr":"gezi, günübirlik tur","fa":"گردش یک‌روزه"},{"a":"accommodation","b":"where you'll stay","tr":"konaklama","fa":"محل اقامت"},{"a":"sold out","b":"there are no tickets left","tr":"tükendi","fa":"تمام شده"},{"a":"half price","b":"it's fifty per cent off","tr":"yarı fiyatına","fa":"نصف قیمت"},{"a":"guided tour","b":"someone shows you round","tr":"rehberli tur","fa":"تور با راهنما"},{"a":"a fortnight","b":"two weeks","tr":"iki hafta","fa":"دو هفته"}],"traps":[{"en":"Advice from a friend: several options are listed and some are rejected. Write the one that is recommended.","tr":"Arkadaş tavsiyesi: birkaç seçenek sayılır, bazıları elenir. Tavsiye edileni yaz.","fa":"توصیه‌ی دوست: چند گزینه گفته می‌شود و بعضی رد می‌شوند. همانی را بنویس که توصیه می‌شود."},{"en":"Two times: \"the boat leaves at ten fifteen, but be there twenty minutes before\". Check which time the heading needs.","tr":"İki saat: \"tekne on on beşte kalkıyor ama yirmi dakika önce orada ol\". Başlığın hangi saati istediğine bak.","fa":"دو ساعت: «قایق ده و ربع حرکت می‌کند، ولی بیست دقیقه زودتر آنجا باش». ببین عنوان کدام ساعت را می‌خواهد."},{"en":"Included or extra: \"lunch is included, but drinks are extra\". Write the item the heading asks about.","tr":"Dahil mi, ekstra mı: \"öğle yemeği dahil ama içecekler ekstra\". Başlığın sorduğu şeyi yaz.","fa":"شامل یا اضافه: «ناهار شامل است، ولی نوشیدنی جداست». چیزی را بنویس که عنوان می‌پرسد."}],"example":{"lines":[["Friend","There’s a ferry at nine and one at eleven."],["Caller","Nine is a bit early with the children."],["Friend","The eleven o’clock is quieter anyway, and you still reach the island in time for lunch."],["Caller","Great, we’ll take that one."]],"item":"Ferry departs at: ___ a.m.","answer":"11","why":{"en":"Nine is rejected as too early. They choose the eleven o’clock ferry: write 11.","tr":"Dokuz çok erken diye eleniyor. Saat on birdeki feribotu seçiyorlar: 11 yaz.","fa":"ساعت نه چون زود است رد می‌شود. کشتیِ ساعت یازده را انتخاب می‌کنند: بنویس 11."}},"general":true,"patterns":["L1-travel"],"often":{"pattern":"L1-travel","n":7,"of":40,"label":{"en":"Comes up often in the real exam: 7 of the last 40 tests","tr":"Gerçek sınavda sık çıkar: son 40 sınavın 7’sinde","fa":"در آزمون واقعی زیاد می‌آید: در ۷ آزمون از ۴۰ آزمونِ اخیر"}}}]},"points":[{"eyebrow":{"en":"In the exam","tr":"Sınavda","fa":"در آزمون"},"head":{"en":"Ten notes, two halves","tr":"On not, iki yarı","fa":"ده یادداشت، دو نیمه"},"body":{"en":"All ten questions are notes under short headings. You read Questions 1-5, listen, then get a short break to read Questions 6-10. The recording plays once and the answers come in order. Write ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER.","tr":"On sorunun hepsi kısa başlıklar altındaki notlardır. Soru 1-5’i okur, dinlersin, sonra Soru 6-10’u okumak için kısa bir ara verilir. Kayıt bir kez çalınır ve cevaplar sırayla gelir. ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER yaz.","fa":"هر ده سؤال یادداشت‌هایی زیر عنوان‌های کوتاه‌اند. سؤال‌های ۱ تا ۵ را می‌خوانی، گوش می‌دهی و بعد یک مکث کوتاه برای خواندن سؤال‌های ۶ تا ۱۰ داری. فایل یک بار پخش می‌شود و جواب‌ها به ترتیب می‌آیند. ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER بنویس."}},{"eyebrow":{"en":"The method","tr":"Yöntem","fa":"روش"},"head":{"en":"Headings, then the gap","tr":"Önce başlıklar, sonra boşluk","fa":"اول عنوان‌ها، بعد جای خالی"},"steps":[{"en":"Read the headings: they tell you when the speakers move on (getting there, on the island, tips).","tr":"Başlıkları oku: konuşanların ne zaman konu değiştirdiğini söylerler (oraya gitmek, adada, ipuçları).","fa":"عنوان‌ها را بخوان: می‌گویند گوینده‌ها کی موضوع را عوض می‌کنند (رفتن، در جزیره، نکته‌ها)."},{"en":"For each gap, predict a time, a price, a name or a noun.","tr":"Her boşluk için bir saat, fiyat, isim ya da ad tahmin et.","fa":"برای هر جای خالی یک ساعت، قیمت، اسم یا اسمِ چیز را حدس بزن."},{"en":"When a friend corrects herself (\"actually, no\"), wait for the new detail.","tr":"Arkadaş kendini düzelttiğinde (\"actually, no\"), yeni bilgiyi bekle.","fa":"وقتی دوست حرفش را اصلاح می‌کند («actually, no»)، منتظر اطلاعات جدید بمان."},{"en":"Write times and prices as figures: 7.45, 26.","tr":"Saatleri ve fiyatları rakamla yaz: 7.45, 26.","fa":"ساعت و قیمت را با رقم بنویس: 7.45، 26."}]},{"eyebrow":{"en":"The trap","tr":"Tuzak","fa":"دام"},"head":{"en":"Friends change their minds","tr":"Arkadaşlar fikir değiştirir","fa":"دوست‌ها حرفشان را عوض می‌کنند"},"body":{"en":"In a chat between friends the first detail is often wrong: an old timetable, a price for people who do not book, a place that \"used to\" be open. The answer is the detail that fits this trip, on this day.","tr":"Arkadaşlar arasındaki sohbette ilk bilgi çoğu zaman yanlıştır: eski bir tarife, rezervasyon yapmayanların fiyatı, eskiden açık olan bir yer. Cevap, bu geziye, bu güne uyan bilgidir.","fa":"در گپ دوستانه اولین اطلاعات اغلب غلط است: یک جدول زمانی قدیمی، قیمت برای کسانی که رزرو نمی‌کنند، جایی که «قبلاً» باز بود. جواب اطلاعاتی است که به همین سفر، در همین روز، می‌خورد."}}],"example":{"eyebrow":{"en":"Worked example","tr":"Çözümlü örnek","fa":"مثال حل‌شده"},"head":{"en":"One note, step by step","tr":"Bir not, adım adım","fa":"یک یادداشت، قدم به قدم"},"instruction":"Complete the notes below. Write ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER for each answer.","item":"Museum tour · starts at ___ am","lines":[["Friend 1","The tour used to start at ten."],["Friend 2","Has that changed?"],["Friend 1","Yes, it’s half past ten now, because the museum opens later in winter."]],"answer":"10.30","walk":[{"en":"Before you listen: the gap needs a morning time.","tr":"Dinlemeden önce: boşluk sabah saatine ait bir zaman istiyor.","fa":"قبل از گوش دادن: جای خالی یک ساعتِ صبح را می‌خواهد."},{"en":"\"Used to start at ten\" is the old time.","tr":"\"Eskiden onda başlardı\" eski saat.","fa":"«قبلاً ساعت ده شروع می‌شد» ساعت قدیمی است."},{"en":"\"It’s half past ten now\": write 10.30 in figures.","tr":"\"Şimdi on buçuk\": rakamla 10.30 yaz.","fa":"«الان ده و نیم است»: با رقم بنویس 10.30."}]},"quick":{"prompt":"Notes: \"Single ticket: £___ (bought on the bus)\". You hear: \"On the app it’s three pounds, but if you pay the driver it’s four.\" What do you write?","options":["3","4","7"],"correct":1,"why":{"en":"The note says \"bought on the bus\", so it is the price you pay the driver: 4.","tr":"Not \"otobüste alınan\" diyor; yani şoföre ödenen fiyat: 4.","fa":"یادداشت می‌گوید «خریده‌شده در اتوبوس»، پس قیمتی که به راننده می‌دهی: ۴."}},"remember":{"en":"Use the headings, wait for corrections, and choose the detail that fits this trip.","tr":"Başlıkları kullan, düzeltmeleri bekle ve bu geziye uyan bilgiyi seç.","fa":"از عنوان‌ها استفاده کن، منتظر اصلاح‌ها بمان و اطلاعاتی را انتخاب کن که به همین سفر می‌خورد."},"type":"explain","id":"c-x03-l1-e","course":"ielts-exams","exam":"exam-03","unit":"x03-l1"},"drill":{"type":"drill","skill":"listening","part":"Listening Part 1","title":{"en":"A day trip to Fennick Island","tr":"Fennick Adası’na günübirlik gezi","fa":"سفر یک‌روزه به جزیره‌ی فنیک"},"timed":8,"ctx":["L1-travel"],"script":[{"who":"Alfie","line":"Morven, have you got a minute? You went to Fennick Island last year, didn't you?"},{"who":"Morven","line":"I did, in September. It was one of the best days out I've had. Are you thinking of going?"},{"who":"Alfie","line":"Yes, with my parents, a week on Saturday. I'm trying to plan it, but the website's a bit confusing."},{"who":"Morven","line":"Well, the boats leave from the north pier, not the main harbour. People go to the wrong place all the time."},{"who":"Alfie","line":"The north pier. Is there parking there?"},{"who":"Morven","line":"There's a small car park, but it's usually full by nine, so I'd get the number twelve bus from the station instead. It stops right outside."},{"who":"Alfie","line":"Good idea. And what time's the first boat?"},{"who":"Morven","line":"When I went, it was quarter to nine... actually, no, that was the summer timetable. From September it's nine fifteen. So you'll want the nine fifteen."},{"who":"Alfie","line":"Nine fifteen. That's fine. Is it expensive?"},{"who":"Morven","line":"If you just turn up, an adult return is twenty-four pounds. But if you book online, it's eighteen, so definitely do that."},{"who":"Alfie","line":"Eighteen online. Can I pay on the boat if I forget?"},{"who":"Morven","line":"No, they don't take any payment on board, not even cards. You really have to buy your tickets online before you go."},{"who":"Alfie","line":"OK. How long is the crossing?"},{"who":"Morven","line":"About forty minutes. Oh, and try to sit on the right-hand side of the boat on the way out. That's the side where you see the seals on the rocks."},{"who":"Alfie","line":"The right-hand side. My mum will love that."},{"who":"Morven","line":"Now, once you're there, you can't take a car; there are no cars on the island at all. Some people walk, but it's twelve kilometres round, so I'd hire a bike at the pier. They've got bikes for adults and children, and they're not expensive."},{"who":"Alfie","line":"Great, a bike. How long does it take to cycle round?"},{"who":"Morven","line":"About two hours if you don't stop, but you will stop, believe me. There are beaches all along the south side."},{"who":"Alfie","line":"And what should we see?"},{"who":"Morven","line":"The lighthouse, definitely. You can climb right to the top, and the view is amazing. But be careful: it's closed on Mondays. There's also a little museum about the keepers next to it, but that's only open in July and August."},{"who":"Alfie","line":"We're going on a Saturday, so that's fine."},{"who":"Morven","line":"For lunch, there's a lovely café in the old school. The children left years ago, and now the building's a café with a little shop."},{"who":"Alfie","line":"In the old school. Who runs it?"},{"who":"Morven","line":"A woman called Mrs Grieve. Tell her I sent you; she'll give you the best table."},{"who":"Alfie","line":"How do you spell that?"},{"who":"Morven","line":"G-R-I-E-V-E. Like the word, but with an E at the end."},{"who":"Alfie","line":"Got it. Anything else I should know?"},{"who":"Morven","line":"Take a waterproof, even if it's sunny when you leave. The weather on the island changes really fast, and there's not much shelter on the cliff path."},{"who":"Alfie","line":"A waterproof. And what time's the last boat back?"},{"who":"Morven","line":"It used to be six o'clock, but they changed it this year, so now it's five thirty. Don't miss it, or you'll be paying for a night in the hotel!"},{"who":"Alfie","line":"Five thirty. Thanks, Morven, that's really helpful."},{"who":"Morven","line":"No problem. Send me a photo from the lighthouse."}],"notes":{"title":"Day trip to Fennick Island","headings":["Getting there","On the island","Practical tips","Getting back"]},"groups":[{"instruction":"Questions 1-10. Complete the notes below. Write ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER for each answer.","qtype":"note","questions":[{"n":1,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Getting there · boats leave from the north pier at ___ am","accept":["9.15","9:15"],"limit":1,"evidence":"From September it's nine fifteen","why":{"en":"Quarter to nine was the summer timetable. \"From September it’s nine fifteen.\"","tr":"Dokuza çeyrek vardı yaz tarifesiydi. \"Eylülden itibaren dokuzu çeyrek geçe.\"","fa":"یک ربع به نه مال جدول تابستان بود. «از سپتامبر ساعت نه و ربع است»."},"trap":["TR-selfcorrect"]},{"n":2,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Getting there · adult return: £___ if booked online","accept":["18"],"limit":1,"evidence":"if you book online, it's eighteen","why":{"en":"£24 is the price \"if you just turn up\". Online it is 18.","tr":"24 £ \"öylece gidersen\" fiyatı. İnternetten 18.","fa":"۲۴ پوند قیمتِ «اگر همین‌طوری بروی» است. آنلاین ۱۸ است."},"trap":["TR-price"]},{"n":3,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Getting there · tickets must be bought ___ (no payment on the boat)","accept":["online"],"limit":1,"evidence":"You really have to buy your tickets online before you go","why":{"en":"\"They don’t take any payment on board... buy your tickets online before you go.\"","tr":"\"Teknede hiçbir ödeme almıyorlar... biletlerini gitmeden önce internetten al.\"","fa":"«داخل قایق هیچ پولی نمی‌گیرند... بلیت‌ها را قبل از رفتن آنلاین بخر»."},"trap":["TR-paraphrase"]},{"n":4,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Getting there · on the way out, sit on the ___ side to see the seals","accept":["right","right-hand"],"limit":1,"evidence":"sit on the right-hand side of the boat","why":{"en":"\"Sit on the right-hand side of the boat on the way out.\" \"side\" is printed.","tr":"\"Giderken teknenin sağ tarafında otur.\" \"side\" yazılı.","fa":"«در مسیر رفت سمت راست قایق بنشین». «side» چاپ شده."},"trap":["TR-printed"]},{"n":5,"kind":"gap","prompt":"On the island · there are no cars, so hire a ___ at the pier","accept":["bike","bicycle"],"limit":1,"evidence":"I'd hire a bike at the pier","why":{"en":"Walking is possible but it is twelve kilometres, so \"I’d hire a bike at the pier\".","tr":"Yürümek mümkün ama on iki kilometre; bu yüzden \"iskelede bisiklet kiralardım\".","fa":"پیاده هم می‌شود، اما دوازده کیلومتر است، پس «در اسکله دوچرخه کرایه می‌کردم»."},"trap":["TR-paraphrase"]},{"n":6,"kind":"gap","prompt":"On the island · climb to the top of the ___ (closed on Mondays)","accept":["lighthouse"],"limit":1,"evidence":"The lighthouse, definitely","why":{"en":"The lighthouse is closed on Mondays. The museum next to it opens only in July and August.","tr":"Deniz feneri pazartesileri kapalı. Yanındaki müze yalnızca temmuz ve ağustosta açık.","fa":"فانوس دریایی دوشنبه‌ها بسته است. موزه‌ی کنارش فقط در ژوئیه و اوت باز است."},"trap":["TR-paraphrase"]},{"n":7,"kind":"gap","prompt":"On the island · lunch at the café in the old ___","accept":["school"],"limit":1,"evidence":"a lovely café in the old school","why":{"en":"\"A lovely café in the old school.\" \"old\" is printed.","tr":"\"Eski okulda çok güzel bir kafe.\" \"old\" yazılı.","fa":"«یک کافه‌ی قشنگ در مدرسه‌ی قدیمی». «old» چاپ شده."},"trap":["TR-printed"]},{"n":8,"kind":"gap","prompt":"On the island · café owner: Mrs ___","accept":["Grieve"],"limit":1,"evidence":"G-R-I-E-V-E","why":{"en":"Spelled G-R-I-E-V-E: I before E, and an E at the end.","tr":"G-R-I-E-V-E diye harf harf söyleniyor: E’den önce I ve sonda bir E.","fa":"حرف به حرف: G-R-I-E-V-E؛ I قبل از E و یک E در آخر."},"trap":["TR-spell"]},{"n":9,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Practical tips · take a ___ even if it is sunny","accept":["waterproof"],"limit":1,"evidence":"Take a waterproof, even if it's sunny","why":{"en":"\"Take a waterproof, even if it’s sunny when you leave.\"","tr":"\"Çıkarken güneşli olsa bile yağmurluk al.\"","fa":"«حتی اگر موقع رفتن آفتابی است، یک بارانی بردار»."},"trap":["TR-paraphrase"]},{"n":10,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Getting back · last boat back: ___ pm","accept":["5.30","5:30"],"limit":1,"evidence":"so now it's five thirty","why":{"en":"Six o’clock was the old time. \"Now it’s five thirty.\"","tr":"Saat altı eski saatti. \"Şimdi beş buçuk.\"","fa":"ساعت شش زمان قدیمی بود. «الان پنج و نیم است»."},"trap":["TR-selfcorrect"]}]}],"audio":{"voices":{"Announcer":{"accent":"British (standard Southern)","gender":"M","tts":{"engine":"kokoro","voice":"bm_george"},"role":"Recorded rubric"},"Morven":{"accent":"Scottish","gender":"F","tts":{"engine":"piper","voice":"en_GB-alba-medium"},"role":"Friend who has made the trip"},"Alfie":{"accent":"British (Southern English)","gender":"M","tts":{"engine":"kokoro","voice":"bm_lewis"},"role":"Friend planning the trip"}},"sequence":[{"type":"announcer","text":"Part 1. You will hear a conversation between two friends about a day trip to an island. First, you have some time to look at Questions 1 to 5."},{"type":"pause","seconds":30,"note":"reading time, Questions 1-5"},{"type":"announcer","text":"Now listen carefully and answer Questions 1 to 5."},{"type":"lines","from":0,"to":17,"note":"two friends in a quiet café; no phone filter"},{"type":"announcer","text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at Questions 6 to 10."},{"type":"pause","seconds":30,"note":"reading time, Questions 6-10"},{"type":"announcer","text":"Now listen and answer Questions 6 to 10."},{"type":"lines","from":18,"to":31},{"type":"announcer","text":"That is the end of Part 1. You now have half a minute to check your answers.","after":30}]},"id":"c-x03-l1-d","course":"ielts-exams","exam":"exam-03","unit":"x03-l1"},"exit":{"type":"exit","items":[{"tests":"word","point":1,"prompt":"A \"return ticket\" lets you...","options":["travel there and back","travel one way only","change the date for free"],"correct":0,"why":{"en":"A return ticket covers the journey there and the journey back.","tr":"Gidiş-dönüş bilet hem gidişi hem dönüşü kapsar.","fa":"بلیت رفت‌وبرگشت هم رفتن و هم برگشتن را شامل می‌شود."}},{"tests":"paraphrase","point":1,"prompt":"Notes say \"no payment on the boat\". Which words in a recording mean the same?","options":["tickets are cheaper on board","you can pay the captain","they don’t take any money on board"],"correct":2,"why":{"en":"On board = on the boat; \"don’t take any money\" = no payment.","tr":"On board = teknede; \"hiç para almıyorlar\" = ödeme yok.","fa":"on board یعنی داخل قایق؛ «هیچ پولی نمی‌گیرند» یعنی پرداختی نیست."}},{"tests":"method","point":2,"prompt":"The friends have started talking about lunch, but you are still waiting for the answer to the note before it. What should you do?","options":["Keep waiting: it will come after lunch","Move on: the answer has passed, so guess it at the end","Leave the rest of the notes empty"],"correct":1,"why":{"en":"Answers come in order. If the talk has moved on, the answer has passed; follow the speakers and guess later.","tr":"Cevaplar sırayla gelir. Konuşma ilerlediyse cevap geçmiştir; konuşanları takip et, sonra tahmin et.","fa":"جواب‌ها به ترتیب می‌آیند. اگر صحبت جلو رفته، جواب رد شده؛ دنبال گوینده‌ها برو و بعداً حدس بزن."}},{"tests":"trap","point":3,"prompt":"Gap: \"first train: ___ am\". You hear: \"It’s ten past seven in summer, but this is winter, so it’s seven forty.\" What do you write?","options":["7.40","7.10","7.10 or 7.40"],"correct":0,"why":{"en":"The summer time does not apply. \"This is winter, so it’s seven forty.\"","tr":"Yaz saati geçerli değil. \"Şimdi kış, yani yedi kırk.\"","fa":"ساعت تابستانی صدق نمی‌کند. «الان زمستان است، پس هفت و چهل دقیقه»."}},{"tests":"trap","point":1,"prompt":"Gap: \"meet by the ___ gate\" (ONE WORD). You hear: \"Let’s meet by the main gate, not the side one.\" What do you write?","options":["main gate","side","main"],"correct":2,"why":{"en":"\"gate\" is printed, so write one word: main. The side gate is ruled out.","tr":"\"gate\" yazılı, tek kelime yaz: main. Yan kapı eleniyor.","fa":"«gate» چاپ شده، پس یک کلمه بنویس: main. در کناری رد می‌شود."}}],"id":"c-x03-l1-x","course":"ielts-exams","exam":"exam-03","unit":"x03-l1"}}; })(globalThis.IELTS_EXAMS = globalThis.IELTS_EXAMS || {});
